OL,3,GNEWSA'My Dalek costume is cheering up
OL,4,Athe over-60s'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe manager of a social club for people
OL,7,Fover 60 said a Doctor Who-themed event
OL,8,F"brought memories flooding back" for
OL,9,Fits members.
OL,11,FPolly McLellan treated her members to
OL,12,Fan unexpected trip through time and
OL,13,Fspace when she arrived at the Warboys
OL,14,FYoung at Heart Club, dressed as a
OL,15,FDalek.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
