OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'My Dalek costume is cheering up
OL,4,Athe over-60s'
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said she had recently bought a
OL,7,Fbundle of second-hand fancy dress
OL,8,Foutfits from her neighbour, to wear for
OL,9,Fthemed days which might strike a chord
OL,10,Fwith the attendees of the
OL,11,FCambridgeshire club - some of whom are
OL,12,Fliving with dementia.
OL,14,FMcLellan explained that the club helped
OL,15,Fto promote social interaction for
OL,16,Fpeople "who are perhaps isolated and
OL,17,Fare looking for some companionship."
